  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Credit for Microenterprise</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Global de Crdito para Microempresas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT SEEKS TO PROVIDE SUPPORT FOR THE MICROENTERPRISE SECTOR IN EL SALVADOR. THROUGH INSTITUTIONAL STRENGTHENING. THE PROGRAM WOULD CONTAIN (I) A GLOBAL CREDIT LINE, (II) TRAINING AND TECHNICAL ASSISTANCE FOR MICROENTREPRENEUERS; AND (III) INSTITUTIONAL STRENGTHENING OF IFIS AND ETAS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
